. Strengthen your walls, set up traps, and prepare for attacks from both nature and the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/extras/8f74597a6e21d36a698bd79358786440.poster.avif?t=1761853357\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/extras/8f74597a6e21d36a698bd79358786440.webm?t=1761853357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/extras/8f74597a6e21d36a698bd79358786440.mp4?t=1761853357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Build and Expand Your Settlement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with nothing and grow your settlement from the ground up. Construct workshops, storage buildings, and defenses. Strengthen your walls, set up traps, and prepare for attacks from both nature and the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/extras/56602c734012bb50cd3ea6289386f53e.poster.avif?t=1761853357\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/extras/56602c734012bb50cd3ea6289386f53e.webm?t=1761853357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/extras/56602c734012bb50cd3ea6289386f53e.mp4?t=1761853357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Explore the Wild Lands</strong><br>Journey through the unknown \u2013 wander across forests, swamps, and mountains, uncovering ancient relics, hidden places, and the secrets of long-forgotten tribes that once worshipped the spirits of this land. Beneath the surface lie <strong>resources, minerals, and rare stones</strong> vital for your settlement\u2019s growth and for crafting powerful tools. The deeper you venture into the wilderness, the greater the danger \u2013 you\u2019ll encounter <strong>older and deadlier creatures</strong>, but also <strong>wandering traders</strong> offering <strong>exotic goods</strong> and rare knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 <strong>Battle Slavic Monsters</strong><br>Face creatures from ancient legends \u2013 <strong>Leshy, Rusalka, Po\u0142udnica, Utopiec</strong>, and other dark beings that haunt dense forests and forgotten ruins on the edge of the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMONSTRATION VERSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limitations:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access to only part of the development tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one settler available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No COOP mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one save slot</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLANNED IMPROVEMENTS FOR THE EARLY ACCESS RELEASE \u2013 MARCH 2026</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introduction of a hint system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to grow a larger variety of crops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded development tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting of weapons, armor, and food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat with various monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control of multiple characters simultaneously</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression (leveling system)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded trading with NPCs and dynamic pricing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introduction of ranged units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addition of fences, corners, walls, and traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to save the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer (co-op) mode \u2013 online connection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved farming with additional bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced visual effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic game saving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgraded sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved user interface (UI)</p></li></ul>","developers":["LukaszD"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/bff33bfef0742d757e15e592186f67b63dc65506/header.jpg?t=1761853357","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3882880/1504954783/3f97babf0ddf825954125288cf37add5b128f2b2/1760218392/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760218917","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3882880/1504954783/3f97babf0ddf825954125288cf37add5b128f2b2/1760218392/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760218917","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3882880/1504954783/3f97babf0ddf825954125288cf37add5b128f2b2/1760218392/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760218917","id":257216207,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216207/movie480.mp4?t=1760218917","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216207/movie_max.mp4?t=1760218917"},"name":"halabarda 2 utopiec","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216207/61a95a1f9576820714e90881807658de42f9706f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760218917","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.stea